fbody=f'''<article><p class="by"><a href="../../">🏆 Sports</a> › <a href="../">NBA Cup 2026</a> › Final at Hinkle</p><span class="pill">Fri Dec 11, 2026</span>
<h1>NBA Cup final at Hinkle Fieldhouse: date, tickets and how to watch on Prime</h1><p class="by">{BY} · Oct 16, 2026</p>
<p>For the first time, the NBA Cup title game leaves Las Vegas, and it's heading somewhere special. <b>Hinkle Fieldhouse</b> at Butler University opened in 1928 and hosted the real-life state final that inspired <i>Hoosiers</i>. Now it gets an NBA trophy game on <b>Friday, December 11</b>.</p>
<table><tr><th>Date</th><td>Friday, Dec 11, 2026</td></tr><tr><th>Tip-off</th><td><b>Not announced yet</b></td></tr><tr><th>Venue</th><td>Hinkle Fieldhouse, 510 W 49th St, Indianapolis, IN 46208</td></tr><tr><th>Watch</th><td>Prime Video only</td></tr><tr><th>Teams</th><td>One East and one West winner. Set after the Dec 8/9 semifinals.</td></tr></table>
<h2>🎟️ Tickets: the honest version</h2><p>Public tickets went on sale Oct 1 at NBAEvents.com, starting around $50, and sold out in under two hours. Your official options now are premium hospitality packages from NBA Experiences, or watching NBAEvents.com for released seats. Hinkle is a college gym, small by NBA standards, so resale will be pricey. Only buy from sellers with real buyer protection.</p>
<div class="links"><a href="https://nbaexperiences.com/nba-cup-2026" {EXT}>NBA Experiences packages</a><a href="https://www.nbaevents.com/" {EXT}>NBAEvents.com</a></div>
<h2>🔎 The scavenger hunt (done)</h2><p>On Oct 1 the NBA hid five game balls around Indy: Plump's Last Shot, the John Wooden statue on Georgia Street, the Butler Bulldog statue, the Sports Legends Experience at the Children's Museum, and the NDY sculpture on Mass Ave. The first fans to return one to Hinkle won tickets. All five have been found.</p>
<h2>🧳 Travel and hotels</h2><p>Hinkle sits in the Butler-Tarkington neighborhood, about 5 miles north of downtown. Downtown hotels put you near the bars and Lucas Oil, then it's a short drive or rideshare to campus. Broad Ripple, a mile or so northeast, is the closest nightlife. Book refundable rooms now; you won't know the teams until Dec 9. Indianapolis International Airport (IND) is about 20 to 30 minutes away.</p>
<div class="links"><a href="https://www.visitindy.com/" {EXT}>Visit Indy</a><a href="https://butlersports.com/" {EXT}>Butler Athletics</a><a href="https://www.ind.com/" {EXT}>IND airport</a></div>
<h2>📺 Watch from home</h2><p>Prime Video has exclusive rights to every knockout game, including this one. <a href="https://www.amazon.com/primevideo" {EXT}>Prime Video</a></p>
{fhtml(FFAQ)}<p><a href="../">← NBA Cup schedule and standings</a></p>{srclist(NSRC[2:])}</article>'''
